            "title": "盤中速報 - 方土昶(6265)股價拉至漲停，漲停價32.45元，成交452張",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>方土昶(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6265:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6265\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6265-TW</a>)24日09:12上漲2.95元，股價漲停報32.45元，委買49,000張，成交452張。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>主要業務為電子零件買賣。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>方土昶(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6265:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6265\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6265-TW</a>)近5日股價下跌14.12%，櫃買市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>下跌15.11%，股價波動與大盤表現同步。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>近5日籌碼</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>三大法人合計買賣超：+1,303 張</li> <li>外資買賣超：+1,322 張</li> <li>投信買賣超：0 張</li> <li>自營商買賣超：-19 張</li> <li>融資增減：-1,115 張</li> <li>融券增減：-16 張</li> </ul></section></main>",
